Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.17,0:01:55.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I accidentally fell in love...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...with the same person...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...as my best friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You'll feel better after drinking some water.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.52,0:02:08.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, the money...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.04,0:02:28.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm feeling sick or anything,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but it's too late to tell him that.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Give me the water.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bought it,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,so I should get to drink it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.22,0:02:47.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't this an...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.23,0:02:48.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,...in-
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.10,0:02:50.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,-direct...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.31,0:02:53.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,...k-ki...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.95,0:02:59.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you a germaphobe or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, that's not exactly it...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to stare like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Fine, I got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So cold! I'm chok—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.93,0:03:26.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Let me grab a towel...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.31,0:03:39.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, looks like I kinda forgot it in the classroom.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.99,0:03:43.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.24,0:03:48.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The day where I finally feel embarrassed about my boorish facade has come.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But the reason everyone else dresses up and uses makeup
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,is to look good for others, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.67,0:04:05.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How is that different from me trying to look cute in front of the boys?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.56,0:04:12.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Those words are really ringing true right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Really loudly...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.11,0:04:18.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,Why am I acting all pure?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.73,0:04:21.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,I messed up my bag and made it dirty on purpose!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,5,,Disgusting! I'm disgusting!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Still feeling sick?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, I'm totally better now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.83,0:04:35.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You use perfume?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh... must be your shampoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know. That turns me on.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Say something...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.34,0:05:28.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, at least show some reaction.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now I just look like a pervert.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.68,0:05:36.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Y-You should make it easier for me to tell you're joking.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.52,0:05:41.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know what to say, silly...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.53,0:05:46.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just got the cheapest shampoo they had at the supermarket. {I don't know why you used drug store}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.03,0:05:52.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Whether he was joking or not, \NI should've gotten something better.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's such a hassle being in love.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.62,0:05:57.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.42,0:05:58.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Of what?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.46,0:06:02.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to pick up some \Nshampoo on the way home. {removing assumptions because unnecessary}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're welcome for the reminder, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.55,0:06:09.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I need to go swing by the drug store.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.80,0:06:13.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure you're better now?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright then. Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.94,0:06:26.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I really do want to walk home with you, Kou,{journey, not destination}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't really feel right doing that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Like I was betraying Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I have to tell her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I need to say I love Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.55,0:06:47.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I have to tell her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.18,0:06:56.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,When you're in love, you become\N aware of the smallest details.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.39,0:07:01.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be a real hassle,\N but the feelings that control you
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,also uplift your spirits.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sorry for the delay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.44,0:07:07.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you have a point card?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.78,0:07:08.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay, I've scanned it in.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.07,0:07:11.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Payment of 3000 yen.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I need to tell Yuuri soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What will Yuuri think?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Will she start to hate me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No, Yuuri wouldn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.82,0:07:57.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Odds and evens! One, two, shoot! {a variation that actually makes sense}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.54,0:08:01.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Naitou! What're you up to?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.54,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Nice, I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.42,0:08:07.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan was my classmate in middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.13,0:08:10.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We were very close friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.13,0:08:14.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Splitting teams for cops and robbers.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's play.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.43,0:08:23.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan had a crush on a boy named Naitou-kun, {}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.35,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,I haven't played this since I was a kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.69,0:08:26.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's like we're back in elementary school!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.57,0:08:29.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.65,0:08:32.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou was standing behind them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.53,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Let me play too!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.53,0:08:34.07,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,What, you serious?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.07,0:08:35.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's all play together!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really? Cops and robbers?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, the girls are in too?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How about it, Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess... I'll play.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then that's that!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.60,0:09:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm counting to one hundred!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.72,0:09:05.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}One! Two! Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.02,0:09:06.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Everything was peaceful throughout my first year in middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.53,0:09:15.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But when the next year rolled around...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't Yoshioka kinda cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.49,0:09:19.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she totally is.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's so refined.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The other girls could learn a thing or two from her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.04,0:09:31.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I started drawing attention, for better or worse.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba's just putting on an act for the guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.38,0:09:37.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right? She pisses me off.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.51,0:09:39.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But even then...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.35,0:09:46.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They're just jealous that the boys are all over you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.98,0:09:49.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Idiots, all of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.69,0:09:56.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She was the only one who stuck by my side.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.78,0:10:02.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But one day...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...Yumi-chan suddenly stopped talking to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.70,0:10:07.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait up, I'll go too!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yumi, are you sure you wanna leave Futaba behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um... yeah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.55,0:10:20.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,My last remaining ally left my side\N without ever telling me why.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.64,0:10:27.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've seen you since graduation.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.94,0:10:36.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Remember Naitou?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The guy you had a crush on?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.58,0:10:49.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, I remember asking you for advice about him all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.33,0:10:53.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good times...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.80,0:10:59.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What a lie. I'd erase that from my memory if I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just don't know what else to say
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.51,0:11:08.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,to someone who deserted me without any explanation.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.57,0:11:18.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You see, one day,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.49,0:11:23.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,a girl told me that you also liked Naitou-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.91,0:11:30.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When I went to ask you about it...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I saw your eyes on him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.68,0:11:47.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I thought, "I'm the one who loved him first!"
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.68,0:11:53.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know that liking someone first doesn't actually mean anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.52,0:11:58.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But by then, I'd lost my reasoning
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.57,0:12:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and was boiling with rage at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.99,0:12:12.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I knew that if I left, you'd be all alone. Sorry—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.63,0:12:19.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I never felt that way about Naitou-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Looking back, there was even another boy I liked.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.18,0:12:32.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew that Naitou-kun was friends with Kou, so I wanted to ask if he'd heard anything,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.14,0:12:36.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,or if he knew anything about how Kou was.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.02,0:12:43.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yumi-chan got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.90,0:12:44.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.12,0:12:47.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,When you fall in love with the person your friend likes,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,this is what happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm happy I got to see you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.27,0:13:18.61,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I was naive.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.32,0:13:28.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that Yuuri might not get mad at me when I told her...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.79,0:13:36.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But just like Yumi-chan, she'll probably end up falling prey to her feelings
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and be overcome with hate.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.50,0:13:45.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why did she have to show up now of all times?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.01,0:13:49.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It feels like God is testing me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.43,0:13:55.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But... I can't lie about my feelings for Kou anymore. {this isn't because of the previous preview, but I think she's talking in general. later in the episode she even tries to lie to herself again}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.10,0:14:00.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I really have no choice but to tell her!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.19,0:14:03.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,How many days has it been since I said that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.74,0:14:13.95,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Just talk to her already, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Useless! Useless! Useless!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.09,0:14:32.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I brought the CD you texted me about yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.02,0:14:35.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.14,0:14:40.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,They text each other?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.65,0:14:43.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's a secret cover he did of his own song on it. {what the fuck is a self-cover?}{when you perform a song that you originally did, but differently}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.27,0:14:45.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You gotta listen to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.45,0:14:50.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri's so lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.45,0:14:51.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What song's your favorite?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.03,0:14:55.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's all so easy when you've got that cute personality established.{cute!=cutesy}{tashikani}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.78,0:14:55.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If I had to pick, it'd be this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What was that? My jealousy's taking over!{I'm acting like a jealous bitch!}{no}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the one used in that commercial.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.71,0:15:05.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.67,0:15:13.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I also understand why Yuuri wants people to think she's cute.{the other hou is her jealous kimochi}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.47,0:15:16.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What is this emotion?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabichi-kun lent me a CD!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's great...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san, good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.90,0:15:28.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.32,0:15:34.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri is just
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.87,0:15:38.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,doing everything she can.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.54,0:15:42.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She's nothing like me, holding everything in.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm the worst.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.76,0:15:51.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?! What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.35,0:15:58.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.52,0:16:00.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.06,0:16:09.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your part of the report had way too many things wrong with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They said we had to redo it and hand it in again.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You got it...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You feeling alright?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.67,0:16:35.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll tell her! I swear I'll tell her...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.84,0:16:36.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll say it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.72,0:16:41.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't say it...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.98,0:16:45.98,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Futaba-chan, not feeling hungry? Are you sick?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.82,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,I bought too much out of habit.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.36,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Yuuri, want a chocolate roll?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.65,0:16:56.57,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,What about anpan? Or a yakisoba roll? {YAKISOBAAAAAA}{sweetbread is a different thing; you can use something to the effect of "red bean paste bun" if you think anpan is too Japanese}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.28,0:16:59.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't eat that much.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.58,0:17:05.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san, want any?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.83,0:17:07.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should return them.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't think they let you return bread.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.38,0:17:16.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll go and check anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.01,0:17:18.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.93,0:17:19.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.23,0:17:30.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did I...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.11,0:17:35.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...do something bad to Futaba-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go after her.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.46,0:17:52.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Excuse me, so you know the girl who always buys a lot... {fffucking bitch}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.54,0:17:53.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to stay friends with Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I also want to stay in love with Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.09,0:18:04.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Guess it's impossible to eat my cake and have it too.{I know the other way is more common, but this is the original order and the only order that makes sense (the original quotation was "eat your cake and have it still"}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.06,0:18:09.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou probably doesn't even see me as a girl anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.27,0:18:12.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,In that case I can keep it a secret from Yuuri
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and just watch him from afar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.86,0:18:21.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, what are you doing?! \NI almost had a heart—
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.87,0:18:25.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Close! Close! Close! Close!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.55,0:18:34.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Crap, he's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.05,0:18:39.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding from him?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.31,0:18:54.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's so stubborn about having dinner together.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why not just do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.24,0:19:09.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His silence is telling me not to pry any further.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you change your shampoo?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wanted to turn you on.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.27,0:19:32.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were right.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.48,0:19:37.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It does get awkward when you can't tell if it's a joke.{冗談って分かりづらい口調 = words whose joke-itude is difficult to ascertain}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.49,0:19:43.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right, well my brother's gone, so I'll be off.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.99,0:19:47.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Watch from afar?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.74,0:19:51.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I try my hardest to make something happen given the slightest chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.92,0:19:55.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I even changed my shampoo for him.{these two lines are "I'm changing my shampoo and doing all these things, meaning I'm doing bad to Yuuri"}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.84,0:19:59.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm doing all sorts of sneaky things behind Yuuri's back.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita was looking for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.97,0:20:10.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She seemed really worried. \NDid something happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.85,0:20:17.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri was worried about me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.32,0:20:25.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of girl she is.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.78,0:20:29.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew Yuuri was a good girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.20,0:20:37.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She's an incredibly dear friend of mine.{"best friend" is kinda a loaded term in jk drama circles}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When you talked to me that day,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,can you imagine just how happy I was?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.05,0:20:48.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's why I'll never leave you alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's why I want us to stay friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.15,0:21:06.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But because she's so dear to me, I have to tell her.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens after that..
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...is up to Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.68,0:21:28.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.14,0:21:34.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The donut shop in front of the station is having a 100-yen sale.{I know ekimae is a broad place but still}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.56,0:21:37.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wanna stop by with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.77,0:21:39.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.40,0:21:45.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.11,0:21:49.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Today, I might lose...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.20,0:21:54.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...a very dear friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even if one of you succeeds,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.34,0:23:33.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll still be on both of your sides.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you two.
